ing  i i want one set of rules that would be  fantastic and then everyone would know  how to react you know people are still  sticking out their hands to shake their  hands i saw it if you watched hard  knocks and i know you didn't watch much  of it i don't think this year but i i  watched all of hard knocks and the first  thing i think it was the first episode  maybe the second when sean mcveigh is  going to cut a player he immediately  reaches out his hand and shakes hand and  i tweeted shot somebody tell sean  mcveigh to stop shaking hands and i know  it's natural and i know it's what we're  accustomed to doing but all those things  have gone away and they're probably  going to go away forever so i don't know  if it's a fist bump or elbow bump or  figure something else out and let's  let's have a rule that what we're gonna  do to uh greet each other and all those  other things would be nice to know  polite non would be great nod a salute  whatever the case may be  hi i'm mike tarico and thanks for  watching make sure to hit subscribe for  the latest news and highlights from nbc  sports
 

